Scope

This license covers the files of this repository, with these exceptions:

  - A file whose head says "Translated from magiblot/tvision" is a translation of that library. It is distributed under
    the terms of COPYRIGHT.magiblot (the disclaimer of Borland International and the MIT license of magiblot and
    contributors), which must be kept with it. The changes made in the translation are also under the license below.
  - The generated tables src/tvcharset.inc, src/tvcp.inc and src/tvwidth.inc hold data derived from the Unicode
    Character Database and the Unicode mapping tables of code pages: see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

